<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>Bigfix Analysis - Microsoft Agent Framework PyPI Compromise</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[
<p>Detects PyPI <code>agent-framework</code> versions 1.26.1 and 1.26.2 (PYSEC-2026-4388), known installed artifact names and RECORD digests, startup-hook and module hashes in the relevant package paths, and either malicious wheel hash under standard user Downloads folders. Any one indicator returns TRUE with the matched path.</p>
<p>Windows scope includes Python3xx folders under the OS drive root, Program Files and Program Files (x86), Python installs under user AppData Local and Roaming, and .venv directly under user profiles. Linux scope includes versioned Python library folders under /usr and /usr/local, user .local libraries under /home and /root, and virtual environments at /opt/venv, /app/.venv and /workspace/.venv. macOS scope includes Python.org framework installs, standard Homebrew library paths and versioned Python kegs, /Library/Python, and standard per-user Library/Python, .local libraries, and .venv directly under home folders.</p>
<p>FALSE applies only to visible artifacts in those locations. A filename or metadata hit is an indicator and does not establish execution or exfiltration. Check custom Python prefixes, other virtual environments, WSL, containers, package caches and historical CI artifacts separately. This Analysis reads files without starting Python or pip. Hunt the defanged network IOC <code>webhook[.]site/d381fd80-ec62-42ad-8f5c-d1b15103c9bb</code> in proxy or EDR telemetry.</p>
<p><a href="https://osv.dev/vulnerability/PYSEC-2026-4388">PyPA advisory PYSEC-2026-4388</a></p>
    ]]></Description>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[windows of operating system or linux of operating system or mac of operating system]]></Relevance>
    <Property Name="IOC Found-" ID="1" EvaluationPeriod="PT6H"><![CDATA[
(if it = "" then "FALSE" else if length of it > 4096 then "TRUE - " & first 4096 of it & "%0a[additional paths truncated]" else "TRUE - " & it)
of concatenation "%0a" of unique values of pathnames of
(
  (
    files "METADATA" whose (size of it <= 65536
      and exists lines whose (it as lowercase = "name: agent-framework") of it
      and exists lines whose (it = "Version: 1.26.1" or it = "Version: 1.26.2") of it)
      of folders ("agent_framework-1.26.1.dist-info"; "agent_framework-1.26.2.dist-info") of it;
    files "RECORD" whose (size of it <= 65536 and exists lines whose (
      it starts with "agent_framework_meta/_telemetry.py,sha256=OfoynyqT9zSwu49a2yA-ozMdGuR5gypQFaVMsXqr1mM,"
      or it starts with "agent_framework_meta.pth,sha256=IfKOhRehD_5DH41o9YdcheykABrm0RgyKwpBhzmY614,"
    ) of it) of folders whose (name of it starts with "agent_framework-" and name of it ends with ".dist-info") of it;
    files ("agent_framework_meta.pth"; "af_runtime_diag.pth"; "af_runtime_diag.py") of it;
    files "_telemetry.py" of folders "agent_framework_meta" of it;
    files whose (name of it ends with ".pth" and size of it <= 65536 and
      (sha256 of it = "21f28e8517a10ffe431f8d68f5875c85eca4001ae6d118322b0a41873998eb5e"
       or sha256 of it = "325e7e9f0ec94e41ad1a1b7a3f18a6b8b5bffece2e2b97b8d3369eb967452f93")) of it;
    files whose (name of it ends with ".py" and size of it <= 65536 and
      (sha256 of it = "39fa329f2a93f734b0bb8f5adb203ea3331d1ae479832a5015a54cb17aabd663"
       or sha256 of it = "c275ccbe520ef3c0f02dc6a35389e427f9f1b4e0b12e140cd7bf7179ce143f02"))
      of folders "agent_framework_meta" of it
  ) of (if windows of operating system then(folders "site-packages" of folders "Lib" of
      (folders whose (name of it as lowercase contains regex "^python3[0-9]+$")
        of (parent folder of windows folder;
            folders ("Program Files"; "Program Files (x86)") of parent folder of windows folder;
            folders "AppData\Local\Programs\Python" of folders of folders "Users" of parent folder of windows folder);
       folders ".venv" of folders of folders "Users" of parent folder of windows folder);
    folders "site-packages" of folders whose (name of it as lowercase contains regex "^python3[0-9]+$")
      of folders "AppData\Roaming\Python" of folders of folders "Users" of parent folder of windows folder)
  else if mac of operating system then
    (folders "site-packages" of folders whose (name of it contains regex "^python3[.][0-9]+$")
      of (folders ("/usr/local/lib"; "/opt/homebrew/lib");
          folders "lib" of folders whose (name of it contains regex "^3[.][0-9]+$")
            of (folders "/Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions";
                folders "Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions" of (folders of folders "/Users"; folders "/var/root");
                folders "Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions"
                  of folders whose (name of it contains regex "^python@3[.][0-9]+$")
                  of folders ("/usr/local/opt"; "/opt/homebrew/opt"));
          folders "lib" of folders whose (name of it contains regex "^python@3[.][0-9]+$")
            of folders ("/usr/local/opt"; "/opt/homebrew/opt");
          folders (".local/lib"; ".venv/lib") of (folders of folders "/Users"; folders "/var/root"));
     folders "site-packages" of folders whose (name of it contains regex "^3[.][0-9]+$") of folders "/Library/Python";
     folders "lib/python/site-packages" of folders whose (name of it contains regex "^3[.][0-9]+$")
       of folders "Library/Python" of (folders of folders "/Users"; folders "/var/root"))
  else
    folders ("site-packages"; "dist-packages") of folders whose (name of it contains regex "^python3[.][0-9]+$")
      of (folders ("/usr/lib"; "/usr/lib64"; "/usr/local/lib"; "/usr/local/lib64"; "/opt/venv/lib"; "/app/.venv/lib"; "/workspace/.venv/lib");
          folders ".local/lib" of (folders of folders "/home"; folders "/root")));
  files ("agent_framework-1.26.1-py3-none-any.whl"; "agent_framework-1.26.2-py3-none-any.whl")
    whose (size of it <= 1048576 and (sha256 of it = "d27fa34414e6201d5e03e559ef634f020057554d7b3f4898dd5d7cd3e989e110" or sha256 of it = "3d20a8bc91351a9a16b6db243b848ceca0206b7a8623b02d2af553a9c9f7e0a9"))
    of (if windows of operating system then
      folders "Downloads" of folders of folders "Users" of parent folder of windows folder
    else if mac of operating system then
      folders "Downloads" of (folders of folders "/Users"; folders "/var/root")
    else folders "Downloads" of (folders of folders "/home"; folders "/root"))
)
    ]]></Property>
  </Analysis>
</BES>
